;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;Mahogany&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\n','','B',1,'',0),(54,'&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;quot;Calibri&amp;quot;,sans-serif&quot;&gt;Planks and chairs can be made from one of these forest products. A. timber B. gum C. ropes and cane D. hide and skin&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\n','&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;quot;Calibri&amp;quot;,sans-serif&quot;&gt;timber&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\n','&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;quot;Calibri&amp;quot;,sans-serif&quot;&gt;gum&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\n','&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;quot;Calibri&amp;quot;,sans-serif&quot;&gt;ropes and cane&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\n','&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;quot;Calibri&amp;quot;,sans-serif&quot;&gt;hide and skin&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\n','','A',1,'',0),(55,'&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;Cocoa, kola and rubber tree are cultivated majorly in the A. Sudan savanna. B. Sahel savanna C. mangrove and swamp forest D. rain forest &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\n','&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;Sudan savanna&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\n','&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;Sahel savanna&lt;/span&gt;&lt