 promote integrity in the society except&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;\n&lt;/ol&gt;\n\n&lt;ol style=&quot;list-style-type:upper-alpha&quot;&gt;\n	&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:14.0000pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri&quot;&gt;Faithfulness (B) Greed (C) Non-compromise of principles (D) Satisfaction&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;\n&lt;/ol&gt;\n','&lt;p&gt;A&lt;/p&gt;\n','&lt;p&gt;B&lt;/p&gt;\n','&lt;p&gt;C&lt;/p&gt;\n','&lt;p&gt;D&lt;/p&gt;\n','','B',1,'',0),(18,'&lt;ol&gt;\n	&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:14.0000pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri&quot;&gt;The current Director General of the world Trade Organization is &amp;hellip;&amp;hellip;&amp;hellip;&amp;hellip;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;\n&lt;/ol&gt;\n\n&lt;ol style=&quot;list-style-type:upper-alpha&quot;&gt;\n	&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:14.0000pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri&quot;&gt;Prof. Ngozi-Okonji Iweala (B) Prof. Chinua Achebe (C) Chief Emeka Anyaoku (D) Mr. Kofi Anan&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;\n&lt;/ol&gt;\n','&lt;p&gt;A&lt;/p&gt;\n','&lt;p&gt;B&lt;/p&gt;\n','&lt;p&gt;C&lt;/p&gt;\n','&lt;p&gt;D&lt;/p&gt;\n','','A',1,'',0),(19,'&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:14.0000pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri&quot;&gt;People who abused political power and public office as leaders cannot be &amp;hellip;&amp;hellip;&amp;hellip;&amp;hellip;&amp;hellip;&amp;hellip;&amp;hellip;&amp;hellip;&amp;hellip;&amp;hellip;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\n\n&lt;ol style=&quot;list-style-type:upper-alpha&quot;&gt;\n	&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:14.0000pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri&quot;&gt;deceived (B) criminalized (C) trusted (D) praised&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;\n&lt;/ol&gt;\n','&lt;p&gt;A&lt;/p&gt;\n','&lt;p&gt;B&lt;/p&gt;\n','&lt;p&gt;C&lt;/p&gt;\n','&lt;p&gt;D&lt;/p&gt;\n','','C',1,'',0),(20,'&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:14.0000pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri&quot;&gt;Lack of integrity in the society will give birth to all these social vices except.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\n\n&lt;ol style=&quot;list-style-type:upper-alpha&quot;&gt;\n	&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:14.0000pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri&quot;&gt;Pilfering (B) Cheating (C) Hard work (D) Looting &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;\n&lt;/ol&gt;\n','&lt;p&gt;A&lt;/p&gt;\n','&lt;p&gt;B&lt;/p&gt;\n','&lt;p&gt;C&lt;/p&gt;\n','&lt;p&gt;D&lt;/p&gt;\n','','C',1,'',0);
