INSERT INTO `b8hausa2ndcaquest583` VALUES (1,'&lt;p&gt;______ na nufin yarjejeniya ce da ke sakanin namiji da mace don zaman tare da kuma samun zuri&amp;#39;a ta gari A. aure B. sata C. suna D. aikatau&lt;/p&gt;\n','&lt;p&gt;A&lt;/p&gt;\n','&lt;p&gt;B&lt;/p&gt;\n','&lt;p&gt;C&lt;/p&gt;\n','&lt;p&gt;D&lt;/p&gt;\n','','A',1,'',0),(2,'&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:14.0000pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&#039;Times New Roman&#039;&quot;&gt;Bride price mean A. sadaki B. goro C. lalle D. wanka amarya &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\n','&lt;p&gt;A&lt;/p&gt;\n','&lt;p&gt;B&lt;/p&gt;\n','&lt;p&gt;C&lt;/p&gt;\n','&lt;p&gt;D&lt;/p&gt;\n','','A',1,'',0),(3,'&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:14.0000pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&#039;Times New Roman&#039;&quot;&gt;Na yi murna da jin haka. Kalma MURNA__ne A. jin dadi B. bakin ciki C. tsoro D. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\n\n&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:14.0000pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&#039;Times New Roman&#039;&quot;&gt;gajiya&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\n','&lt;p&gt;A&lt;/p&gt;\n','&lt;p&gt;B&lt;/p&gt;\n','&lt;p&gt;C&lt;/p&gt;\n','&lt;p&gt;D&lt;/p&gt;\n','','A',1,'',0),(4,'&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:14.0000pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&#039;Times New Roman&#039;&quot;&gt;Ware bare A.farin ciki B. bakin cikiC. dariya D. murmushi&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\n','&lt;p&gt;A&lt;/p&gt;\n','&lt;p&gt;B&lt;/p&gt;\n','&lt;p&gt;C&lt;/p&gt;\n','&lt;p&gt;D&lt;/p&gt;\n','','B',1,'',0),(5,'&lt;p&gt;Last burn in a family in Hausa is--------- A. sarki B. auta C. yaya D. mama&lt;/p&gt;\n','&lt;p&gt;A&lt;/p&gt;\n','&lt;p&gt;B&lt;/p&gt;\n','&lt;p&gt;C&lt;/p&gt;\n','&lt;p&gt;D&lt;/p&gt;\n','','B',1,'',0),(6,'&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:14.0000pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&#039;Times New Roman&#039;&quot;&gt;Kalma dake nuna aiki cikin jimla itace? A. suna B. aikatau C. bayyanau D. Siffa&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\n','&lt;p&gt;A&lt;/p&gt;\n','&lt;p&gt;B&lt;/p&gt;\n','&lt;p&gt;C&lt;/p&gt;\n','&lt;p&gt;D&lt;/p&gt;\n','','B',1,'',0),(7,'&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:14.0000pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&#039;Times New Roman&#039;&quot;&gt;Duk waddanan tufafin maza ne ban da A. wando B. zane C. babba riga D. Jallabiya.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\n','&lt;p&gt;A&lt;/p&gt;\n','&lt;p&gt;B&lt;/p&gt;\n','&lt;p&gt;C&lt;/p&gt;\n','&lt;p&gt;D&lt;/p&gt;\n','','B',1,'',0),(8,'&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:14.0000pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&#039;Times New Roman&#039;&quot;&gt;Guda ana yin ta don nuna___ A. bakin ciki B. firgita C. gajiya D. murna&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\n','&lt;p&gt;A&lt;/p&gt;\n','&lt;p&gt;B&lt;/p&gt;\n','&lt;p&gt;C&lt;/p&gt;\n','&lt;p&gt;D&lt;/p&gt;\n','','D',1,'',0),(9,'&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;