gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\n','&lt;p&gt;A&lt;/p&gt;\n','&lt;p&gt;B&lt;/p&gt;\n','&lt;p&gt;C&lt;/p&gt;\n','&lt;p&gt;D&lt;/p&gt;\n','','B',0.5,'',0),(58,'&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;Which of the following is NOT a health effect of drug abuse? &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;,serif&quot;&gt;A. Insomnia (sleeplessness)&lt;br /&gt;\nB. Palpitation or irregular heartbeat C. Enhanced immune response D. Difficulty in breathing&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\n','&lt;p&gt;A&lt;/p&gt;\n','&lt;p&gt;B&lt;/p&gt;\n','&lt;p&gt;C&lt;/p&gt;\n','&lt;p&gt;D&lt;/p&gt;\n','','C',0.5,'',0),(59,'&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;How can parents help prevent drug abuse in children? &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;,serif&quot;&gt;A. By allowing children to use drugs under supervision B. By helping children develop healthy lifestyles and seeking medical advice when needed C. By ignoring their children&amp;#39;s behavio rD. By encouraging children to experiment with drugs&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\n','&lt;p&gt;A&lt;/p&gt;\n','&lt;p&gt;B&lt;/p&gt;\n','&lt;p&gt;C&lt;/p&gt;\n','&lt;p&gt;D&lt;/p&gt;\n','','B',0.5,'',0),(60,'&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;What is the meaning of &