INSERT INTO `computerpretestquest335` VALUES (1,'ICT is an acronym that stands for:','Information Communication Transfer','Information and Communications Technology','Information and Communication Transportation','Information Certification Technology','','B',1,'',1),(2,'What is data that has been processed to be meaningful to the receiver called?','Communication','Technology','Information','Signal','','C',1,'',2),(3,'The process of sharing ideas, information, and messages with others in a particular time and place is known as:','Technology','Information','Communication','Broadcasting','','C',1,'',3),(4,'The general term for processes by which human beings fashion tools and machines to increase their control and understanding of the material environment is:','Information','Communication','Technology','ICT','','C',1,'',4),(5,'The convergence of telephone networks with computer networks through a single cabling system to transmit information from one place to another is known as:','Information Technology','Broadcasting','ICT','Telecommunication','','C',1,'',5),(6,'What does Information Technology (IT) primarily deal with?','The study of human behavior','The use of electronic computers and software to manage information','The creation of artistic designs','The development of social media platforms','','B',1,'',6),(7,'Which of the following is a product of ICT?','Personal Computers (PCs)','Traditional typewriters','Hand-drawn maps','Analog clocks','','A',1,'',7),(8,'Which of the following is NOT listed as a type of ICT?','Broadcasting','Telecommunication','Data Network','Agriculture','','D',1,'',8),(9,'The distribution of audio and video content to a dispersed audience through a medium such as radio or television is called:','Narrowcasting','Telecommunication','Broadcasting','Data Networking','','C',1,'',9),(10,'Broadcasting to a very narrow range of audience is called:','Broadcasting','Narrowcasting','Telecasting','Radiocasting','','B',1,'',10),(11,'Which type of broadcasting is an audio (sound) broadcasting service, broadcast through the air as radio waves?','Television Broadcasting','Satellite TV System Broadcasting','Radio Broadcasting','Digital Broadcasting','','C',1,'',11),(12,'Radio broadcasting may be via which type of stations?','VHF or UHF','AM or FM','Analog or Digital','Cable or Satellite','','B',1,'',12),(13,'Digital television broadcasting transmits audio and video by which type of signals?','Analog signals','Sound waves','Digital signals','Light waves','','C',1,'',13),(14,'Television broadcasting is usually on which frequencies?','Low Frequency (LF) or Medium Frequency (MF)','Very-High Frequency (VHF) or Ultra-High Frequency (UHF)','Super High Frequency (SHF) or Extremely High Frequency (EHF)','Very Low Frequency (VLF) or High Frequency (HF)','','B',1,'',14),(15,'A service that delivers television programming to viewers by relaying it from a communications satellite orbiting the Earth directly to the viewer\'s location is called:','Terrestrial Television','Cable Television','Satellite TV System Broadcasting','Internet Protocol Television (IPTV)','','C',1,'',15),(16,'The outdoor parabolic antenna used to receive satellite signals is usually referred to as a:','Signal tower','Satellite dish','Antenna array','Receiver dish','','B',1,'',16),(17,'Telecommunications is the exchange of information over significant distances using:','Smoke signals','Carrier pigeons','Electronic medium','Hand gestures','','C',1,'',17),(18,'Which unit of a basic telecommunication system takes information and converts it to a signal?','Receiver','Transmission medium','Transmitter','Decoder','','C',1,'',18),(19,'The physical channel that carries the signal in a telecommunication system is also called the:','Transmitter','Receiver','Transmission medium','Signal processor','','C',1,'',19),(20,'GSM stands for:','General System Management','Global Satellite Mobile','Global System for Mobile communications','General Satellite Messaging','','C',1,'',20),(21,'A telecommunications technology by which two network nodes establish a dedicated communications channel before they communicate is known as:','Packet Switching','Circuit Switching','Message Switching','Broadcasting','','B',1,'',21),(22,'What is a type of mobile phone that connects to orbiting satellites?','Cell phone','Smartphone','Satellite Telephone System','Landline phone','','C',1,'',22),(23,'Wireless devices or systems that are situated in fixed locations, such as an office or home, and transmit signals through the air are called:','Mobile Wireless','Fixed Wireless','Portable Wireless','Roaming Wireless','','B',1,'',23),(24,'What is a telecommunication network operated for the exchange of information between data communication devices such as computers?','Information System','Data Network','Broadcasting System','Communication System','','B',1,'',24),(25,'Which type of data network is organized around an individual person, connecting devices like mobile computers and cell phones in a small office or residence?','LAN','WAN','MAN','PAN','','D',1,'',25),(26,'A group of computers in close proximity to each other, such as in an office building, a school, or a home, forms a:','WAN','MAN','LAN','PAN','','C',1,'',26),(27,'A type of network that extends throughout a city or a large campus is called a:','LAN','WAN','MAN','PAN','','C',1,'',27),(28,'Which type of computer network spans across a large geographical area, such as a state, province, or country?','LAN','MAN','WAN','PAN','','C',1,'',28),(29,'The data network that spans all over the world through satellites and telephones, connecting users with services such as e-mails and the World Wide Web, is the:','Intranet','Extranet','Internet','Local Area Network','','C',1,'',29),(30,'A set of interrelated components that works together to collect, process, store, and break down information to support decision making is called an:','Operating System','Application Software','Information System','Hardware System','','C',1,'',30);
