y:Calibri,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;In any school, the largest number of the members is that of the &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\n\n&lt;p style=&quot;margin-left:0.5in; margin-right:0in; text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;(a) teachers (b) prefects (c) students (d) gardeners &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\n','&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;teachers&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\n','&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;prefects&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\n','&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;students&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\n','&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;gardeners&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\n','','C',1,'',0),(16,'&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;Jonathan loved David as his own soul because he (a) was present when David came to his father (b) saw that David was a brave boy (c) had a genuine love for David (d) found out that David was like a brother to him.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\n','&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;was present when David came to his father&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\n','&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;saw that David was a brave boy&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\n','&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;had a genuine love for David&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\n','&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;found out that David was like a brother to him.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\n','','B',1,'',0),(17,'&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;The school consists of ____ groups (a) four (b) three (c) five (d) two&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\n','&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;four&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\n','&lt;p&gt;three&lt;/p&gt;\n','&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;five&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\n','&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;two&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\n','','C',1,'',0),(18,'&lt;ol&gt;\n	&lt;li style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;Who is the next to the Principal in the hierarchy of school family? &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;\n&lt;/ol&gt;\n\n&lt;p style=&quot;margin-left:0.5in; margin-right:0in; text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;(a) Subject Teachers (b) the Secretary (c) Vice- Principal (d) Bursar &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\n','&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;Subject Teachers&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\n','&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;the Secretary&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\n','&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;Vice- Principal&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\n','&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;Bursar&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\n','','C',1,'',0),(19,'&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;Limited family is commonly found in &amp;hellip;&amp;hellip;&amp;hellip;.. system of family&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\n\n&lt;ol style=&quot;list-style-type:lower-alpha&quot;&gt;\n	&lt;li style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;biological (b)domestic (c)extended (d)nuclear&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;\n&lt;/ol&gt;\n','&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;biological&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\n','&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;domestic&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\n','&lt;p&gt;extended&lt;/p&gt;\n','&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;nuclear&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\n','','D',1,'',0),(20,'&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;Friends must show -------- to one another. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\n\n&lt;ol style=&quot;list-style-type:lower-alpha&quot;&gt;\n	&lt;li style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;sincere love (b) eye service (c) pride (d) envy&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;\n&lt;/ol&gt;\n','&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;sincere love&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\n','&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11pt&