&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri,&amp;quot;sans-serif&amp;quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;serif&amp;quot;&quot;&gt;2b. Mention two (2) federal consumer agencies. ------1mark&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\n'),(17,4,108,'&lt;p style=&quot;margin-left:0in; margin-right:0in; text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri,&amp;quot;sans-serif&amp;quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;serif&amp;quot;&quot;&gt;ESSAY (SECTION B) INSTRUCTION: Answer all the questions.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\n\n&lt;p style=&quot;margin-left:0in; margin-right:0in; text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri,&amp;quot;sans-serif&amp;quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;serif&amp;quot;&quot;&gt;1a. What is voting? (&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;quot;Bookman Old Style&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;serif&amp;quot;&quot;&gt;&amp;frac12;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;serif&amp;quot;&quot;&gt;mark)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\n\n&lt;p style=&quot;margin-left:0in; margin-right:0in; text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri,&amp;quot;sans-serif&amp;quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;serif&amp;quot;&quot;&gt;1b. Mention four information voters must know. (1&amp;frac12; mark)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\n\n&lt;p style=&quot;margin-left:0in; margin-right:0in; text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri,&amp;quot;sans-serif&amp;quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;serif&amp;quot;&quot;&gt;2a. Explain Consumer rights. (&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;quot;Bookman Old Style&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;serif&amp;quot;&quot;&gt;&amp;frac12;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt; mark)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\n\n&lt;p style=&quot;margin-left:0in; margin-right:0in; text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri,&amp;quot;sans-serif&amp;quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;serif&amp;quot;&quot;&gt;2b. Identify two features of democracy and explain one. (1mark)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\n\n&lt;p style=&quot;margin-left:0in; margin-right:0in; text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri,&amp;quot;sans-serif&amp;quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;serif&amp;quot;&quot;&gt;3a. Define the term political parties. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;serif&amp;quot;&quot;&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;quot;Bookman Old Style&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;serif&amp;quot;&quot;&gt;&amp;frac12;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt; mark)&lt;/span&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\n\n&lt;p style=&quot;margin-left:0in; margin-right:0in; text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri,&amp;quot;sans-serif&amp;quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;serif&amp;quot;&quot;&gt;3b. Enumerate two important pillars of democracy and explain one. (1mark)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\n\n&lt;p style=&quot;margin-left:0in; margin-right:0in; text-align:center&quot;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\n'),(18,27,122,'&lt;p style=&quot;margin-left:0cm; margin-right:0cm; text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:14.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;quot;Bookman Old Style&amp;quot;,serif&quot;&gt;1. &lt;em&gt;Read the following passage carefully and answer the questions on it.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\n\n&lt;p style=&quot;margin-left:0cm; margin-right:0cm; text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:14.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;quot;Bookman Old Style&amp;quot;,serif&quot;&gt;Death is inevitable and so human beings are bound to die however long one expects to live. But the most painful form of death is to lose a loved one through accidents. The most common accident is road accident. How does it feel for one to see a loved one off to a motor-park only to be informed a few hours or days later that such a person (the traveller) died or got maimed through road accident? Well, the factors responsible for road accidents are obvious.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\n\n&lt;p style=&quot;margin-left:0cm; margin-right:0cm; text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:14.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;quot;Bookman Old Style&amp;quot;,serif&quot;&gt;Most drivers especially vehicle owners who chose to drive themselves often lose concentration while sitting behind the wheels. The first factor is probably the most serious that can easily lead to an accident. A man who had just had a brawl with his wife before he jumped into his vehicle would surely wage a lost battle with road accident. There is also the problem of phoning while driving, and then comes deep thoughts of indebtedness to either an individual or an organisation or various lost deals.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\n\n&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:14.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;quot;Bookman Old Style&amp;quot;,serif&quot;&gt;a. In &lt;strong&gt;one&lt;/strong&gt; sentence, state the intention of the writer.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\n\n&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:14.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;quot;Bookman Old Style&amp;quot;,serif&quot;&gt;b. In &lt;strong&gt;two &lt;/strong&gt;sentences, &lt;strong&gt;one&lt;/strong&gt; for each, summarize the causes of road accidents.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\n\n&lt;p style=&quot;margin-left:0cm; margin-right:0cm; text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\n\n&lt;p style=&quot;margin-left:0cm; margin-right:0cm; text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:14.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;quot;Bookman Old Style&amp;quot;,serif&quot;&gt;2. Identify the type of sentences below:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\n\n&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:14.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;quot;Bookman Old Style&amp;quot;,serif&quot;&gt;a. John came yesterday and saw the food on the table.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\n\n&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:14.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;quot;Bookman Old Style&amp;quot;,serif&quot;&gt;b. A very large woman with a checked head-tie covering her hair looked at me from the floor pleadingly.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\n\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:14.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;quot;Bookman Old Style&amp;quot;,serif&quot;&gt;c. I wanted to go to the concert after the tickets were sold out.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\n\n&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:14.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;quot;Bookman Old Style&amp;quot;,serif&quot;&gt;d. John and Blessing came to my house last night.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\n\n&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:14.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;quot;Bookman Old Style&amp;quot;,serif&quot;&gt;e. I am taking English test;I am sure I will do well because I really studied hard.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\n'),(19,22,130,'&lt;p style=&quot;margin-left:0.5in; margin-right:0in; text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri,&amp;quot;sans-serif&amp;quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;serif&amp;quot;&quot;&gt;1a (i) What is renewable energy?&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\n\n&lt;p style=&quot;margin-left:0.5in; margin-right:0in; text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri,&amp;quot;sans-serif&amp;quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;serif&amp;quot;&quot;&gt;1a (ii) List four renewable energy sources&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\n\n&lt;p style=&quot;margin-left:0in; margin-right:0in; text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri,&amp;quot;sans-serif&amp;quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;serif&amp;quot;&quot;&gt;1b A car travelling at a constant speed of 30ms&lt;sup&gt;-1&lt;/sup&gt; for 20s was suddenly decelerated when the driver sighted a pot-hole. It took the driver 6s to get to the pot-hole with a reduced speed of 18 ms&lt;sup&gt;-1&lt;/sup&gt;. He maintained the steady speed for another 10s to cross the pot-hole. The brakes were then applied and the car came to rest 5s later.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\n\n&lt;ol style=&quot;list-style-type:lower-roman&quot;&gt;\n	&lt;li style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri,&amp;quot;sans-serif&amp;quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;serif&amp;quot;&quot;&gt;Draw the velocity-time graph for the journey &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;\n	&lt;li style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri,&amp;quot;sans-serif&amp;quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;serif&amp;quot;&quot;&gt;Calculate the deceleration during the last 5s of the journey &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;\n	&lt;li style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri,&amp;quot;sans-serif&amp;quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;serif&amp;quot;&quot;&gt;Calculate the total distance covered                  &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;\n&lt;/ol&gt;\n\n&lt;p style=&quot;margin-left:0.5in; margin-right:0in; text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri,&amp;quot;sans-serif&amp;quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;serif&amp;quot;&quot;&gt;2. An object of mass 5kg moves round a circle of radius 6m. If the period of the motion is &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;quot;Cambria Math&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;serif&amp;quot;&quot;&gt;&amp;pi;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;serif&amp;quot;&quot;&gt;s, calculate the force towards the center.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\n\n&lt;p style=&quot;margin-left:0.5in; margin-right:0in; text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\n'),(20,23,127,'&lt;p style=&quot;margin-left:0cm; margin-right:0cm&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri,&amp;quot;sans-serif&amp;quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;serif&amp;quot;&quot;&gt;SECTION B: ESSAY&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\n\n&lt;ol&gt;\n	&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri,&amp;quot;sans-serif&amp;quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;serif&amp;quot;&quot;&gt;Give the grammatical name and function of the following underlined expressions.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;\n&lt;/ol&gt;\n\n&lt;ol style=&quot;list-style-type:lower-roman&quot;&gt;\n	&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri,&amp;quot;sans-serif&amp;quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-siz