yle=&quot;margin-left:0in; margin-right:0in&quot;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\n\n&lt;p style=&quot;margin-left:0in; margin-right:0in&quot;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\n\n&lt;p style=&quot;margin-left:0in; margin-right:0in&quot;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\n\n&lt;p style=&quot;margin-left:0in; margin-right:0in&quot;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\n'),(187,303,135,'&lt;p style=&quot;margin-left:0in; margin-right:0in; text-align:center&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:9.0pt&quot;&gt;SECTION B&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\n\n&lt;p style=&quot;margin-left:0in; margin-right:0in; text-align:center&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:9.0pt&quot;&gt;ESSAY&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:9.0pt&quot;&gt;: Answer &lt;strong&gt;QUESTION ONE&lt;/strong&gt; and any other question from this section.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\n\n&lt;ol&gt;\n	&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:9.0pt&quot;&gt;A) Assuming that the total deposits of a commercial is N200000, and the cash deposit ratio is 5%, &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;\n&lt;/ol&gt;\n\n&lt;p style=&quot;margin-left:0.5in; margin-right:0in&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:9.0pt&quot;&gt;determine i) Total money lent out, ii) Money created. [3marks]&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\n\n&lt;p style=&quot;margin-left:0.5in; margin-right:0in&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:9.0pt&quot;&gt;B) Highlight two factors affecting credit creation. [2marks]&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\n\n&lt;p style=&quot;margin-left:0in; margin-right:0in&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:9.0pt&quot;&gt;2. a) What is central bank? [2 marks] B) Mention and explain three ways the activities of commercial banks can be controlled by the central bank. [3 marks]&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\n\n&lt;p style=&quot;margin-left:0in; margin-right:0in&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:9.0pt&quot;&gt;3. Write short notes on the following: i) insurance ii) broker iii) jobber iv) money market v) stock exchange.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\n'),(188,304,135,'&lt;p style=&quot;margin-left:0.5in; margin-right:0in&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;,serif&quot;&gt;SECTION B&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\n\n&lt;p style=&quot;margin-left:0.5in; margin-right:0in&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;,serif&quot;&gt;ESSAY : Answer all the questions in this section&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\n\n&lt;ol&gt;\n	&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;,serif&quot;&gt;The following is the trading account for Nigeria in the year 1978 (in millions) &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;\n&lt;/ol&gt;\n\n&lt;p style=&quot;margin-left:0.5in; margin-right:0in&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;,serif&quot;&gt;(a) Citizens private expenditure = N35m &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\n\n&lt;p style=&quot;margin-left:0.5in; margin-right:0in&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;,serif&quot;&gt;(b) Government expenditure on goods and services = N15.6m &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\n\n&lt;p style=&quot;margin-left:0.5in; margin-right:0in&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;,serif&quot;&gt;(c) Various stocks at home = N11.8m &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\n\n&lt;p style=&quot;margin-left:0.5in; margin-right:0in&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;,serif&quot;&gt;(d) Exports income from abroad = N13.5m &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\n\n&lt;p style=&quot;margin-left:0.5in; margin-right:0in&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;,serif&quot;&gt;(e) Imports income paid abroad = N10.4m &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\n\n&lt;p style=&quot;margin-left:0.5in; margin-right:0in&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;,serif&quot;&gt;(f) Taxes on expenditure = N7m &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\n\n&lt;p style=&quot;margin-left:0.5in; margin-right:0in&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;,serif&quot;&gt;(g) Capital consumption = N5.8m &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\n\n&lt;p style=&quot;margin-left:0.5in; margin-right:0in&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;,serif&quot;&gt;(h) General subsidies = N1.3m &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\n\n&lt;p style=&quot;margin-left:0.5in; margin-right:0in&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;,serif&quot;&gt;From the information given above, calculate the national income for Nigeria for the year 1978 &lt;strong&gt;(2 mrks)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\n\n&lt;ol start=&quot;2&quot;&gt;\n	&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;,serif&quot;&gt;ai Define National Income (&amp;frac12; mrk)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;\n&lt;/ol&gt;\n\n&lt;p style=&quot;margin-left:0in; margin-right:0in&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;,serif&quot;&gt;ii. Explain two uses of National Income accounting to Nigeria? (1mrk)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\n\n&lt;p style=&quot;margin-left:0in; margin-right:0in&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;,serif&quot;&gt;b State three reasons or motives why people demand for money (1&amp;frac12; mrk)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\n\n&lt;p style=&quot;margin-left:0in; margin-right:0in&quot;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\n'),(189,305,133,'&lt;p style=&quot;margin-left:0cm; margin-right:0cm; text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;SECTION B: ESSAY QUESTIONS&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\n\n&lt;p style=&quot;margin-left:0cm; margin-right:0cm&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;INSTRUCTION: Answer &lt;em&gt;&lt;u&gt;all&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/em&gt; questions in this section.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\n\n&lt;ol