INSERT INTO `foodsandnutss2cat2quest446` VALUES (1,'Which of the following is most suitable for a traditional wedding ceremony in Nigeria?','Pizza and burgers','Jollof rice and moi-moi','Noodles and sausages',' Mashed potatoes and gravy','','B',0.25,'',1),(2,'A typical food item served at a cocktail party is:',' Egusi soup and pounded yam',' Finger foods and small chops','Yam porridge and fish','Coconut rice and beans','','B',0.25,'',2),(3,'Which meal is commonly associated with a European dish?','Eba and okra soup','Chicken curry with naan',' Grilled steak with mashed potatoes','? Fried plantain and pepper sauce','','C',0.25,'',3),(4,'One of the most important considerations when preparing food for special occasions is:','Matching the guests? clothes','Guest?s dietary needs',' Decorations of the venue',' Type of music played','','B',0.25,'',4),(5,'Which of these dishes is not traditionally African?','Tuwon shinkafa',' Egusi soup','Sushi rolls',' Fufu and vegetables','','C',0.25,'',5),(6,'During a naming ceremony, which of the following is least likely to be served?','Soft drinks and snacks','Traditional soups and rice',' Bottled water',' Chinese noodles','','D',0.25,'',6),(7,'In buffet service, guests are expected to:',' Sit and be served by waiters','Choose and serve themselves from a variety of dishes','Be served only drinks','? Eat standing up only','','B',0.25,'',7),(8,'The correct method for preparing tea is:',' Boil milk and pour over sugar','Add cold water to tea leaves and sugar','Pour boiling water over tea leaves and allow to steep','  Blend tea leaves with lemon','','C',0.25,'',8),(9,'The main ingredient in cocoa drinks is:',' Coffee powder','Tea leaves','Cocoa powder','Lemon juice','','C',0.25,'',9),(10,'One major difference between fruit juice and fruit drink is that fruit drink:',' Contains more pulp','Is always sugar-free','May contain artificial additives','  Is made from only fresh fruits','','C',0.25,'',10),(11,'Which of the following is a milk-based beverage?',' Coffee','Zobo','Eggnog','  Lemonade','','C',0.25,'',11),(12,'The best method for preserving homemade orange juice is:','Freezing','Keeping in open container','Mixing with salt','  Leaving under the sun','','A',0.25,'',12),(13,'Which of the following beverages is usually served hot?',' Pineapple juice',' Lemonade','Tea',' Orange drink','','C',0.25,'',13),(14,'An entrepreneur is a person who:',' Manages other people?s businesses',' Buys and sells goods in a shop','Starts and manages a business for profit','  Works for government agencies only','','C',0.25,'',14),(15,'One advantage of entrepreneurship is:',' Irregular income',' Independence and self-reliance',' High risk of failure','? Limited working hours','','B',0.25,'',15),(16,'Which of these is not a quality of a good entrepreneur?',' Creativity',' Laziness','Risk-taking ability',' Persistence','','B',0.25,'',16),(17,'A catering enterprise should be sited in a location that has:',' High rent and poor access',' Low population','Constant demand and good visibility',' Complex roads and hidden address','','C',0.25,'',17),(18,'A major factor that contributes to the success of a food business is',' Large number of employees','Use of expired ingredients',' Quality customer service',' High noise level','','C',0.25,'',18),(19,'One reason for food packaging is to:',' Increase the price unnecessarily','Hide bad content',' Prevent contamination','Make food heavy','','C',0.25,'',19),(20,'A suitable packaging material for hot snacks is:',' Nylon bag',' Banana leaf','Foil paper','  Tissue paper','','C',0.25,'',20);
