INSERT INTO `foodsnutss2cat1quest245` VALUES (1,'A suitable meal for a lacto-vegetarian should include bread and','egg custard ',' fish ','milk ',' sausage.','','C',0.25,'',1),(2,'Which of the following pieces of advice is best for an obese? ','Cut down on daily water intake',' Avoid carbohydrate foods ',' Reduce daily energy intake ',' Cut out all fat from the diet.','','C',0.25,'',2),(3,'Which of the following may a strict vegetarian consume? ','Soyabean milk, rice and beans fruit salad ','Cowmilk, groundnut, millet, fruit salad ','Savoury omelette, rice and beans, fruit salad ',' Savoury rice, stuffed tomatoes, cheese, pudding.','','A',0.25,'',3),(4,'Food items which appear regularly in the diet and in large quantities are ','fast foods ','diary foods ','staple foods ',' convenience foods.','','C',0.25,'',4),(5,'Family size determines the ________ in meal planning and preparation. ','amount of money spent','brand of cooking utensils ',' choice of seasoning ','  place to shop for foodstuff.','','A',0.25,'',5),(6,'A person who is on a diet to lose weight should consume foods',' high in cholesterol ','high in fat ',' low in protein ',' low in calories.','','D',0.25,'',6),(7,' A good party guest should have the following qualities except ','arrogance ','moderation','politeness ',' neatness.','','A',0.25,'',7),(8,'Which of the following is the most important factor in planning meals? ','Size of the family ',' Income ',' Food value ','Season.','','B',0.25,'',8),(9,'Which of the following is not the role of a waiter?',' Attends to table emergencies','Clears tables after guests eat. ',' Receives guests on arrival',' Serves food on tables. ','','C',0.25,'',9),(10,'Which of the following should be considered in setting a table? ','number of individuals taking the meals',' beauty of the cutlery ',' cost of the dishes to be served ','attractiveness of the meals.','','A',0.25,'',10),(11,'The hostess should be served',' first ',' second ','after the guest ',' before guests arrive.','','C',0.25,'',11),(12,'In a formal meal service, food is served by','dietician ',' chef ',' waiter ','? host.','','C',0.25,'',12),(13,'A meal service where guests serve themselves is ',' picnic ',' luncheon ','cocktail ','buffet.','','D',0.25,'',13),(14,'In planning meals for an invalid, the first consideration should be ','food availability ','patient?s preference ',' type of service ',' doctor?s advice.','','D',0.25,'',14),(15,'An appropriate dessert for a vegan is ',' banana tart ','queen of puddings ',' fruit jelly','welsh rarebit.','','C',0.25,'',15),(16,'In a formal table setting, the knife that is placed on the side plate is the','carving knife ',' fish knife ',' butter knife ','  bread knife.','','B',0.25,'',16),(17,'Which of the following require the greatest intake of protein? ',' Company executive ','Manual worker ','Teenage girl ',' Bank worker.','','C',0.25,'',17),(18,'High intake of iron-rich foods during pregnancy prevents _______ ','kwashiorkor ','marasmus ','anaemia',' pellagra.','','C',0.25,'',18),(21,'&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\n\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt=&quot;&quot; src=&quot;../../questUploadImages/questionImages/1593873396.png&quot; style=&quot;height:166px; width:356px&quot; /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\n\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri,&amp;quot;sans-serif&amp;quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;The diagram below illustrates a type of meal service. Study it and answer questions 19 and 20&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\n\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri,&amp;quot;sans-serif&amp;quot;; font-size:12pt&quot;&gt;The meal service is called A. cocktail B. buffet C. English D. continental&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\n','&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:16px&quot;&gt;A&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\n','&lt;p&gt;B&lt;/p&gt;\n','&lt;p&gt;C&lt;/p&gt;\n','&lt;p&gt;D&lt;/p&gt;\n','','B',0.25,'',0),(23,'&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt=&quot;&quot; src=&quot;../../questUploadImages/questionImages/1656902357.png&quot; style=&quot;height:166px; width:356px&quot; /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\n\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri,&amp;quot;sans-serif&amp;quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;The diagram below illustrates a type of meal service. Study it and answer questions 19 and 20 &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\n\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri,&amp;quot;sans-serif&amp;quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;The service is best suitable for A. large group of people B. small number of people C. business luncheon D. child&amp;rsquo;s birthday party.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\n','&lt;p&gt;A&lt;/p&gt;\n','&lt;p&gt;B&lt;/p&gt;\n','&lt;p&gt;C&lt;/p&gt;\n','&lt;p&gt;D&lt;/p&gt;\n','','A',0.25,'',0);
