piration dates ',' Buying expired or spoiled food ',' Cooking food properly','','C',0.5,'',38),(39,'What is a precaution to ensure safety in food purchase? ','Buying food from street vendors ',' Checking food packaging ',' Ignoring expiration dates ','? Buying food without inspecting it','','B',0.5,'',39),(40,'What is a consumer right? ',' Right to safety ',' Right to information ',' Right to choose ','All of the above','','D',0.5,'',40),(41,'What is a challenge faced by consumers? ',' Limited choices ',' High prices ','Poor quality products',' All of the above','','D',0.5,'',41),(42,'What is bulk purchasing? ','Buying small quantities of food ',' Buying large quantities of food ',' Buying food online ','? Buying food from street vendors','','B',0.5,'',42),(43,'What is an advantage of bulk buying? ',' Reduced cost ',' Increased waste',' Limited storage space ',' All of the above','','A',0.5,'',43),(44,'What is food processing? ','Cooking food online ',' Preserving food only ',' Transforming raw ingredients into consumable products ',' Storing food only','','C',0.5,'',44),(45,'Why is food processing important? ',' To extend shelf life ','To improve nutritional value','To enhance flavor ',' All of the above','','D',0.5,'',45),(46,'A thread made by twisting or spinning fibers are called___',' fabrics ','yarn ',' woven fabric ','? crotchet','','A',0.5,'',46),(47,'Normal child?s growth follows a ___ steady pattern',' definite ',' sudden ','indefinite ','unpredictable. ','','A',0.5,'',47),(48,'____ helps to shape the development and provides many opportunities which help to broaden child?s cultural outlook.',' society ','special care',' food ','good clothes.','','A',0.5,'',48),(49,'Cramp in the intestine of the baby is a childhood ailment caused by ___',' constipation','colic ',' fever ','nappy rash ','','B',0.5,'',49),(50,' ____ involves the passing of hard stool at long intervals or not passing stool at all. ','constipation ',' stooling','stomach upse','? running stomac