INSERT INTO `jss2socialstudies3trmexamsquest620` VALUES (1,'Drug trafficking is connected with trading on','Legal drugs','Medical drugs','Illegal drug','Herbal drugs','','C',0.5,'',1),(2,'Lack of readiness in marriage produces the following except','constant fight','divorce','broken home','happiness and love','','D',0.5,'',2),(3,'Social studies do not have universally acceptable definition because','it draws its content from various disciplines','it is discriminating','its scholars are myopic','its methods are simple','','A',0.5,'',3),(4,'In the family, a child will gain experience in the following ways except','footballing','greeting','dressing ','eating habig','','A',0.5,'',4),(5,'Money laundering is a/an.','national crime','domestic crime','internal crime','international crime','','D',0.5,'',5),(6,'The first environment of a child is the','school','womb and family','womb and school','church and market','','B',0.5,'',6),(7,'The total way of life of a particular group of people is known as','lifestyle','culture','behavior','conduct','','B',0.5,'',7),(8,'Which of the following is NOT a type of marriage?','Traditional marriage','Nocturnal marriage','Ordinance marriage','Religious marriage','','B',0.5,'',8),(9,'Group behavior may be','positive or negative','rejected by the members','government approved','original or fake','','A',0.5,'',9),(10,'The chronic dependence on a particular thing is called','Abuse','Addiction','Hard drug','Heroin','','B',0.5,'',10),(11,'The following are examples of community service except','Rotary club voluntary service','vigilante group work','strike','self-help project','','C',0.5,'',11),(12,'Marriage does the following except','gives rights and duties','unifies the people','means of tracing interest','imprison its members','','D',0.5,'',12),(13,'Drug trafficking is a global problem that requires collaborated efforts of the following bodies except','UNDOC','ASUU','NDLEA','NGOs','','B',0.5,'',13),(14,' Constitutionally, a girl is not ready for marriage until','she is employed','age eighteen','age twenty-five','she become beautiful','','B',0.5,'',14),(15,'The following are types of drugs that can be abused except','vegetable','cigarettes','heroin','narcotic','','A',0.5,'',15),(16,'The National Drug Law Enforcement Agency (NDLEA) is an example of which of the following?','Anti- drug control agency','Pro-drug agency','free drug enforcement agency','Anti-apartheid agency','','A',0.5,'',16),(17,'All of these countries are into drug trafficking except','Abuja','Mexico','Colombia','China','','A',0.5,'',17),(18,'Which of the following ministries does NAFDAC belong?','Federal Ministry of Health','Federal Ministry of Commerce','Federal Ministry of Labor','Federal Ministry of World Health Organization','','A',0.5,'',18),(19,'The food that is no longer fresh and therefore unpleasant to eat is referred to','fresh food','poorly cooked food','stale food','rotten food','','C',0.5,'',19),(20,'Drug abuse is a-----','social problem','social concept','social contact','social liability','','A',0.5,'',20),(21,'The difference between licit and illicit drug is that','one is sweet the other is bitter','one is liquid the other solid','one is legal the other illegal','one is potent the other is impotent','','C',0.5,'',21),(22,'Which of the following is NOT a way of abusing drug?','ingestion','egestion','injection','inhalation','','B',0.5,'',22),(23,'Admonition not to toy with marriage means','stop using toy before marriage','plan and prepare adequately before marriage','buy toys for their children','not marry at all.','','B',0.5,'',23),(24,'Extended family members play the following roles in the life of a child except','becoming a role model','provision of finance','promotion of fear','instilling moral values','','C',0.5,'',24),(25,'The smallest unit in the society is','family','school','mass media','church','','A',0.5,'',25),(26,'Children perform all the following roles in the family except','running errand in the family','paying bills','doing household chores','respect other members of the family','','B',0.5,'',26),(27,'A marriage of one man to one woman is known as','polygamy','polygyny','monogamy','polyandry','','C',0.5,'',27),(28,'Restriction of marriage partner to one’s relation or bloodline is known as','incest','endogamy','exogamy','surrogate','','B',0.5,'',28),(29,'The acronym UNODC means','United Nations Office on Development and Crime','Unified Nations Organization on Development and Centralization','United Nations Office on Drugs and Crime','United Nations Office on Development and Community','','C',0.5,'',29),(30,'Which of the following category of drugs is most frequently trafficked?','heroin','oxycodone','crack cocaine','methamphetamine','','A',0.5,'',30),(31,'Death penalty was imposed on drug traffickers in Nigeria in the year','1990','1960','1781','1984','','D',0.5,'',31),(32,'Which of these agencies is not related to drug trafficking?','NDLEA','NAFDAC','NAPTIP','Girls Guide','','D',0.5,'',32),(33,'Drug trafficking makes a country to be rated ____ by the international community.','great','poor','high','good','','B',0.5,'',33),(34,'Which method of teaching social studies enables students to observe and give report of their observation?','Discussion method','Participation/Role playing method','Excursion method','Direct instruction method','','C',0.5,'',34),(35,'The components of social studies content that involves the process of knowing, understanding and learning something with the use of the brain is','Afffective domain','Psychomotor domain','cognative domain','Affective-Psychormotor domain','','B',0.5,'',35),(36,'One of these is not a grassroots-based organization','Town union','Women forum','Age grades','ASUU','','D',0.5,'',36),(37,'The current Director General of National Agency For Food','','','','','','C',0.5,'',37),(38,'Which of the following is NOT a feature of commitment in family bonding?','each family member is precious','the family come first in everything','Family members forgive each other','the family member discriminates among themselves','','D',0.5,'',38),(39,'A family is a group of people related by','blood','marriage','adoption','all of the above','','D',0.5,'',39),(40,'The two environments of a man are','Trees and land','Physical and social','Social and surroundings','Plants and Animals','','B',0.5,'',40),(41,'NAFDAC was officially established in Nigeria in','January 1, 1994','January 1, 1993 ','January 1,2001','January 1, 2021','','B',0.5,'',41),(42,'Which of the following reasons for drug trafficking can be blamed on the government?','negative peer influence','unemployment','greed','lack of self-discipline','','B',0.5,'',42),(43,'The insatiable desire for material possession which drives people into drug trafficking is called','greed','self-discipline','financial goal','wealth','','A',0.5,'',43),(44,'Marijuana can be referred to as the following except','cannabis','LSD','Indian hemp','weed','','B',0.5,'',44),(45,'Death, imprisonment and breakdown of law and order are some of the consequences of ','Drug Use','drug addiction','drug trafficking','drug sales','','C',0.5,'',45),(46,'Drug trafficking can be prevented through the following means except','ineffective law enforcement','establishment of skill acquisition scheme','poverty alleviation','legislation','','A',0.5,'',46),(47,'The NOA can help to prevent drug abuse and drug trafficking through','threats and violence','public enlightenment','criticism','mob action','','B',0.5,'',47),(48,'The content of social studies includes all of these except','skills','facts','values','love','','D',0.5,'',48),(49,'Social Studies can be taught through how many methods?','6','4','3','2','','A',0.5,'',49),(50,'The full meaning of SON is','School outreach of Nigeria','Standard Organization of Nigeria','Supreme Office of Nigeria','Special Organization of Nigeria','','B',0.5,'',50),(51,'Family bond promotes','laziness','historical basis','creativity tendencies','unity and understanding','','D',0.5,'',51),(52,'Payment of--- price is required during traditional marriage.','groom','bride','parents','spiritual','','B',0.5,'',52),(53,'The first African country to legalize the use of cannabis is','South Africa','Nigeria','Ethiopia','Niger','','A',0.5,'',53),(54,'One of these is a reason for drug trafficking','self-esteem','discipline','ignorance','contentment','','C',0.5,'',54),(55,'Who among these does not use harmful substances such as cocaine,heroin','Cultist','Rapist','Armed Robbers','Children','','D',0.5,'',55),(56,'Which of the following subjects is not related to social studies?','History','Geography','Biology','Sociology','','C',0.5,'',56),(57,'Negative attitudes towards our environments can be corrected through','mathematics','social Studies','treachery','terrorism','','B',0.5,'',57),(58,'The view or opinion that is generally expressed about something or someone is regarded as','Communication','Education','Reputation','Protection','','C',0.5,'',58),(59,'The role of a father in the family include the following except','cooking food for the family','Keeping the house and its environment clean','Providing the children with quality education','Running errands for the children','','D',0.5,'',59),(60,'Traditional Institutions can adopt the following measures to fight drug trafficking except','Educate the people on the effects of drug abuse.','Give supports to all anti-drug programmes','Condone drug users and traffickers','Identify and fish out culprits','','C',0.5,'',60);
