INSERT INTO `letscat23rdtermquest547` VALUES (1,'1. What does the acronym TEAM stand for? A. Together Everyone Acts Maturely?B. Together Everyone Achieves Much?C. Time Enables All Men?D. Teachers Equip All Members','A','B','C','D','','B',1,'',1),(2,'2. Pastor W.F. Kumuyi is best known as the founder of which ministry? A. The Living Faith Church?B. Deeper Christian Life Ministry?C. Christ Embassy?D. Gospel Faith Mission','A','B','C','D','','B',1,'',2),(3,'3. What is T.L. Osborn most noted for? A. Political activism?B. Faith-based crusades and miracles?C. Music ministry?D. Business leadership','A','B','C','D','','B',1,'',3),(4,'4. TEAM emphasizes the power of what? A. Individual genius?B. Silent meditation?C. Collaboration and unity?D. Fast decision-making','A','B','C','D','','C',1,'',4),(5,'5. Which of these qualities best describes Pastor W.F. Kumuyi? A. Worldly and wealthy?B. Humble and disciplined?C. Silent and shy?D. Loud and proud','A','B','C','D','','B',1,'',5),(6,'6. T.L. Osborn?s ministry style was marked by what major emphasis? A. Academic teaching?B. Deliverance sessions?C. Healing crusades and evangelism?D. Financial prosperity','A','B','C','D','','C',1,'',6),(7,'7. According to TEAM, when people work together, they can? A. Waste less time?B. Compete effectively?C. Achieve more?D. Avoid correction','A','B','C','D','','C',1,'',7),(8,'8. Pastor Kumuyi began his Christian journey as? A. An evangelist in Ghana?B. A mathematics lecturer turned Bible teacher?C. A singer in a gospel band?D. A Catholic missionary','A','B','C','D','','B',1,'',8),(9,'9. T.L. Osborn and his wife were widely known for? A. Launching music albums?B. Hosting gospel movies?C. Traveling worldwide for crusades?D. Managing Bible schools in Africa','A','B','C','D','','C',1,'',9),(10,'10. TEAM can also help to teach young people? A. To lead in isolation?B. To compete for attention?C. To cooperate and contribute?D. To argue for position','A','B','C','D','','C',1,'',10),(11,'11. Pastor Kumuyi is widely respected for his stand on? A. Entertainment gospel?B. Personal holiness and sound doctrine?C. Church business growth?D. Political campaigns','A','B','C','D','','B',1,'',11),(12,'12. T.L. Osborn inspired many through his? A. International healing crusades?B. Sports evangelism?C. Business seminars?D. Farming projects','A','B','C','D','','A',1,'',12),(13,'13. A key message from both Kumuyi and Osborn is that? A. Faith is outdated?B. God uses only the rich?C. Anyone can be used by God?D. Teams are dangerous','A','B','C','D','','C',1,'',13),(14,'14. TEAM encourages us to see others as? A. Competitors?B. Partners in purpose?C. Strangers?D. Problems','A','B','C','D','','B',1,'',14),(15,'15. Pastor Kumuyi\'s teaching method is mostly? A. Entertainment-based?B. Drama and comedy?C. Expository and Scripture-based?D. Motivational only','A','B','C','D','','C',1,'',15),(16,'16. Osborn believed that miracles? A. Should not be expected today?B. Were only for apostles?C. Are signs of God?s love and power?D. Depend on luck','A','B','C','D','','C',1,'',16),(17,'17. TEAM as a concept helps destroy what negative trait? A. Hard work?B. Independence?C. Pride and selfishness?D. Faith and unity','A','B','C','D','','C',1,'',17),(18,'18. Pastor Kumuyi?s example teaches young leaders to be? A. Famous before faith?B. Godly, focused, and disciplined?C. Careless with doctrine?D. Open to every worldly idea','A','B','C','D','','B',1,'',18),(19,'19. T.L. Osborn believed the Gospel should be shared with? A. Only Christians?B. Only Americans?C. The whole world?D. Only adults','A','B','C','D','','C',1,'',19),(20,'20. Which of these is a shared lesson from both heroes of faith? A. Speak without studying?B. Trust in self?C. Total dependence on God?D. Compete to be the greatest\n\n','A','B','C','D','','C',1,'',20);
