lt;/p&gt;\n\n			&lt;p style=&quot;margin-left:0cm; margin-right:0cm&quot;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\n			&lt;/td&gt;\n			&lt;td style=&quot;height:42.3pt; vertical-align:top; width:72.0pt&quot;&gt;\n			&lt;p style=&quot;margin-left:0cm; margin-right:0cm&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;,serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;(D) 16 &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\n			&lt;/td&gt;\n			&lt;td style=&quot;height:42.3pt; vertical-align:top; width:33.25pt&quot;&gt;\n			&lt;p style=&quot;margin-left:0cm; margin-right:0cm; text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;,serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;(E) 10 &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\n			&lt;/td&gt;\n		&lt;/tr&gt;\n	&lt;/tbody&gt;\n&lt;/table&gt;\n','&lt;p&gt;A&lt;/p&gt;\n','&lt;p&gt;B&lt;/p&gt;\n','&lt;p&gt;C&lt;/p&gt;\n','&lt;p&gt;D&lt;/p&gt;\n','','B',0.5,'',0),(6,'&lt;p style=&quot;margin-left:0.5pt; margin-right:0cm&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;,serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;The raw scores of 20 pupils in a Mathematics test are: &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\n\n&lt;p style=&quot;margin-left:0.5pt; margin-right:0cm&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;,serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt; 5, 3, 19, 1, 10, 8, 2, 0, 2, 0, 10, 0, 16, 14, 0, 12, 0, 8, 0, 10 &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\n\n&lt;p style=&quot;margin-left:0.5pt; margin-right:0cm&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;,serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;Use the information to answer questions 6 &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\n\n&lt;table cellspacing=&quot;0&quot; class=&quot;TableGrid&quot; style=&quot;border-collapse:collapse; border:undefined; width:321.4pt&quot;&gt;\n	&lt;tbody&gt;\n		&lt;tr&gt;\n			&lt;td style=&quot;height:42.3pt; vertical-align:top; width:216.1pt&quot;&gt;\n			&lt;p style=&quot;margin-left:0.5pt; margin-right:0cm&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;,serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;6. How many pupils scored more than 13? &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\n			&lt;/td&gt;\n			&lt;td style=&quot;height:42.3pt; vertical-align:top; width:72.0pt&quot;&gt;\n			&lt;p style=&quot;margin-left:0cm; margin-right:0cm&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;,serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\n			&lt;/td&gt;\n			&lt;td style=&quot;height:42.3pt; vertical-align:top; width:33.25pt&quot;&gt;\n			&lt;p style=&quot;margin-left:0cm; margin-right:0cm; text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;,serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\n			&lt;/td&gt;\n		&lt;/tr&gt;\n		&lt;tr&gt;\n			&lt;td style=&quot;height:18.55pt; vertical-align:bottom; width:216.1pt&quot;&gt;\n			&lt;p style=&quot;margin-left:0cm; margin-right:0cm&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;,serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;(A) 3  (B) 12  (C) 16 &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\n			&lt;/td&gt;\n			&lt;td style=&quot;height:18.55pt; vertical-align:bottom; width:72.0pt&quot;&gt;\n			&lt;p style=&quot;margin-left:0cm; margin-right:0cm&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;,serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;(D) 11 &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\n			&lt;/td&gt;\n			&lt;td style=&quot;height:18.55pt; vertical-align:bottom; width:33.25pt&quot;&gt;\n			&lt;p style=&quot;margin-left:0cm; margin-right:0cm; text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;,serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;(E) 17 &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\n			&lt;/td&gt;\n		&lt;/tr&gt;\n	&lt;/tbody&gt;\n&lt;/table&gt;\n','&lt;p&gt;A&lt;/p&gt;\n','&lt;p&gt;B&lt;/p&gt;\n','&lt;p&gt;C&lt;/p&gt;\n','&lt;p&gt;D&lt;/p&gt;\n','','A',0.5,'',0),(7,'&lt;p style=&quot;margin-left:0.5pt; margin-right:0cm&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;,serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;7. The number of goats on a farm is represented on a pie chart as 30&lt;sup&gt;o&lt;/sup&gt;. If there are 180 animals on the farm, how many goats are on the farm? &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\n\n&lt;p style=&quot;margin-left:0.5pt; margin-right:0cm&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;,serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;(A)15 goats  (B) 25 goats  (C) 30 goats  (D) 35 goats (E) 40 goats &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\n','&lt;p&gt;A&lt;/p&gt;\n','&lt;p&gt;B&lt;/p&gt;\n','&lt;p&gt;C&lt;/p&gt;\n','&lt;p&gt;D&lt;/p&gt;\n','','A',0.5,'',0),(8,'&lt;p style=&quot;margin-left:0.5pt; margin-right:0cm&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;,serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\n\n&lt;p style=&quot;margin-left:0.5pt; margin-right:0cm&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;,serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;8. A circular chart which divides a circle into sectors to represents an item in a data set is called? &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\n\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;,serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;(A) Pictogram (B) Bar Chart  (C) Pie Chart  (D) Table  (E) Circular&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\n','&lt;p&gt;A&lt;/p&gt;\n','&lt;p&gt;B&lt;/p&gt;\n','&lt;p&gt;C&lt;/p&gt;\n','&lt;p&gt;D&lt;/p&gt;\n','','C',0.5,'',0),(9,'&lt;p style=&quot;margin-left:0.5pt; margin-right:0cm&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;,serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;quot;Calibri&amp;quot;,sans-serif&quot;&gt;Arranging data either from the least to the highest or from highest to least is known as?&lt;/span&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\n\n&lt;p style=&quot;margin-left:0.5pt; margin-right:0cm&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;,serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;(A) Rearrangement (B) Ordering (C) Ranking (D) Sorting (E) Ascending &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\n','&lt;p&gt;A&lt;/p&gt;\n','&lt;p&gt;B&lt;/p&gt;\n','&lt;p&gt;C&lt;/p&gt;\n','&lt;p&gt;D&lt;/p&gt;\n','','B',0.5,'',0),(10,'&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;,serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;12. The total possible outcome of an event in a probability is called ___ (A) Output (B) Input (C) Sample space (D) Occurrence (E) None of the above.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\n','&lt;p&gt;A&lt;/p&gt;\n','&lt;p&gt;B&lt;/p&gt;\n','&lt;p&gt;C&lt;/p&gt;\n','&lt;p&gt;D&lt;/p&gt;\n','','C',0.5,'',0),(11,'&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;,serif&quot;&gt;What is the range of the following set of numbers 225, 222, 228, 224, 229, 227, and 223? (A) 6 (B) 4 (C) 5 (D) 7&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\n','&lt;p&gt;A&lt;/p&gt;\n','&lt;p&gt;B&lt;/p&gt;\n','&lt;p&gt;C&lt;/p&gt;\n','&lt;p&gt;D&lt;/p&gt;\n','','D',0.5,'',0),(12,'&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;​​​​​​​&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;,serif&quot;&gt;Punch cards were made up of (A) punch tape (B) soft paper (C) hard paper (D) carbon paper &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\n','&lt;p&gt;A&lt;/p&gt;\n','&lt;p&gt;B&lt;/p&gt;\n','&lt;p&gt;C&lt;/p&gt;\n','&lt;p&gt;D&lt;/p&gt;\n','','C',0.5,'',0),(13,'&lt;ol&gt;\n	&lt;li style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;,serif&quot;&gt;Write the binary code for the word ANT (A) 011 100 1111 (B) 1010 111 10000 (C) 01 1110 10100 (D) 100 01 1010&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;\n&lt;/ol&gt;\n','&lt;p&gt;A&lt;/p&gt;\n','&lt;p&gt;B&lt;/p&gt;\n','&lt;p&gt;C&lt;/p&gt;\n','&lt;p&gt;D&lt;/p&gt;\n','','C',0.5,'',0),(14,'&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;​​​​​​​&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;,serif&quot;&gt;Change 10 in decimal code to binary code (A) 100 (B) 110 (C)101 (D) 1010&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\n','&lt;p&gt;A&lt;/p&gt;\n','&lt;p&gt;B&lt;/p&gt;\n','&lt;p&gt;C&lt;/p&gt;\n','&lt;p&gt;D&lt;/p&gt;\n','','D',0.5,'',0),(15,'&lt;ol&gt;\n	&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:14.0pt&quot;&gt;Which of the following is sufficient information for the construction of a triangle?&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;\n&lt;/ol&gt;\n\n&lt;ol style=&quot;list-style-type:lower-roman&quot;&gt;\n	&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:14.0pt&quot;&gt;All the three sides&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;\n	&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:14.0pt&quot;&gt;Two sides and an angle between them&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;\n	&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:14.0pt&quot;&gt;Two angles and a side joining them&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;\n&lt;/ol&gt;\n\n&lt;ol style=&quot;list-style-type:upper-alpha&quot;&gt;\n	&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:14.0pt&quot;&gt;i only B. ii only C. i, ii and iii D. iii only&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;\n&lt;/ol&gt;\n','&lt;p&gt;A&lt;/p&gt;\n','&lt;p&gt;B&lt;/p&gt;\n','&lt;p&gt;C&lt;/p&gt;\n','&lt;p&gt;D&lt;/p&gt;\n','','C',0.5,'',0),(16,'&lt;p style=&quot;margin-left:36pt; margin-right:0cm&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:14.0pt&quot;&gt;The table below shows the scores of students in a test. Use the table to answer the question&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\n\n&lt;table border=&quot;1&quot; cellspacing=&quot;0&quot; class=&quot;MsoTableGrid&quot; style=&quot;border-collapse:collapse; border:solid windowtext 1.0pt; margin-left:36.0pt&quot;&gt;\n	&lt;tbody&gt;\n		&lt;tr&gt;\n			&lt;td style=&quot;vertical-align:top; width:116.75pt&quot;&gt;\n			&lt;p style=&quot;margin-left:0cm; margin-right:0cm&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:14.0pt&quot;&gt;Scores&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\n			&lt;/td&gt;\n			&lt;td style=&quot;vertical-align:top; width:27.05pt&quot;&gt;\n			&lt;p style=&quot;margin-left:0cm; margin-right:0cm&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:14.0pt&quot;&gt;13&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\n			&lt;/td&gt;\n			&lt;td style=&quot;vertical-align:top; width:26.95pt&quot;&gt;\n			&lt;p style=&quot;margin-left:0cm; margin-right:0cm&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:14.0pt&quot;&gt;14&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\n			&lt;/td&gt;\n			&lt;td style=&quot;vertical-align:top; width:22.5pt&quot;&gt;\n	