'Storing','Postpone','','B',0.5,'',37),(38,'Why is it important to conduct regular safety inspections in the workplace?','To create playing ground','Timely measures to avoid accident and injury','to affect workers','to see to advice','','B',0.5,'',38),(39,'How can employees contribute to maintaining a safe work environment?','By gossip','By query','By reporting','by law','','C',0.5,'',39),(40,'What does it mean to \" look\" before crossing the road?','wait before crossing','access both ways before crossing','approaching vehicles','edge of the road','','B',0.5,'',40),(41,'What does a green traffic light signify?','Move','straight','stop','Stand','','A',0.5,'',41),(42,'What is the primary purpose of a pedestrian bridge?','To provide a safe passage for pedestrians over busy roads or intersections.','to cross roads','To overload the road','to sign at users','','A',0.5,'',42),(43,'Social Studies originated from ____','Nigeria','U.S.A','Iraq','Ghana','','B',0.5,'',43),(44,'World War I was in ____','1914 1918','1939 1945','1909 1953','1967 1970','','A',0.5,'',44),(45,'Comprehensive High School, where Social Studies was first taught in Nigeria is in the present ____ state','Ogun','Oyo','Osun','Kwara','','A',0.5,'',45),(46,'Which of the following Nigerian universities took active part in the early stage of Social Studies development in Nigeria?','University of Ilorin','University of Jos','Ahmadu Bello University','University of Lagos','','A',0.5,'',46),(47,'The civil war in Nigeria was between _________','1960 and 1978','1980 and 1988','1967 and 1970','1960 and 1963','','C',0.5,'',47),(48,'48. In the development of social studies as a school subject, the first sets of textbooks produced were for ____','Form I -III','JSS I and II','Form I only','Forms I and II','','D',0.5,'',48),(49,'A group of people in which members know each other very well is known as ______','voluntary group','legal group','secondary group','primary group','','D',0.5,'',49),(50,'One of these is an example of primary group:','trade union','market','office','family','','D',0.5,'',50),(51,'The group where membership is small and depend on one another is called ______','education group','independent group','tertiary group','primary group','','D',0.5,'',51),(52,' When a man marries more than one wife and the family is nuclear, it is said to be ____','polyandrous ','polygynous ','polygamous ','monogamous ','','C',0.5,'',52),(53,'The head of the family is the ____','father','mother','uncle','chief','','A',0.5,'',53),(54,'The smallest social unit in the society is the ___','Church','Family','Hamlet','School','','B',0.5,'',54),(55,'The blood relationship through the mothers side could be described as ___','maternity relationship','mother blood relationship','matrilineal relationship','matrimonial relationship','','C',0.5,'',55),(56,'Child abuse relates closely with ---------------','Human trafficking.','HIV AIDS.','Cultism.','Rigging of election.','','A',0.5,'',56),(57,'Pirate Confraternity is an example of','cult.','Church.','Club.','Fellowship.','','A',0.5,'',57),(58,'HIV/AIDS cannot be contacted through one of the following means.','Unprotected sex','Sharing of toothbrush','Shaking hands with the victim','Blood transfusion','','C',0.5,'',58),(59,'One of the following causes poverty','abundant mineral resources .','Inability to create wealth by the government and the people','Abundant natural resources.','Poor climate.','','B',0.5,'',59),(60,'Denial of admission suffered by innocent candidates is one of the effects of','Area boy syndrome.','Advance fee fraud.','Rigging.','Examination malpractice.','','D',0.5,'',60);
