INSERT INTO `ss2crscat23rdterm2025quest761` VALUES (1,'&lt;p style=&quot;margin-left:0cm; margin-right:0cm; text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri,&amp;quot;sans-serif&amp;quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;serif&amp;quot;&quot;&gt;What was Amos&amp;#39; primary concern in his prophecies? A) Ritual worship B) Social justice C) Foreign policy D) Economic growth&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\n','&lt;p&gt;A&lt;/p&gt;\n','&lt;p&gt;B&lt;/p&gt;\n','&lt;p&gt;C&lt;/p&gt;\n','&lt;p&gt;D&lt;/p&gt;\n','','B',0.25,'',0),(2,'&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;serif&amp;quot;&quot;&gt;According to Amos, what is true religion? A) Offering sacrifices and rituals B) Practicing justice and righteousness C) Building grand temples D) Observing religious holidays&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\n','&lt;p&gt;A&lt;/p&gt;\n','&lt;p&gt;B&lt;/p&gt;\n','&lt;p&gt;C&lt;/p&gt;\n','&lt;p&gt;D&lt;/p&gt;\n','','B',0.25,'',0),(3,'&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;serif&amp;quot;&quot;&gt;What social issue did Amos condemn? A) Poverty B) Oppression of the poor C) Corruption D) All of the above&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\n','&lt;p&gt;A&lt;/p&gt;\n','&lt;p&gt;B&lt;/p&gt;\n','&lt;p&gt;C&lt;/p&gt;\n','&lt;p&gt;D&lt;/p&gt;\n','','D',0.25,'',0),(4,'&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;serif&amp;quot;&quot;&gt;Amos emphasized the importance of: A) Ritual purity B) Moral purity C) External worship D) Tradition &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\n','&lt;p&gt;A&lt;/p&gt;\n','&lt;p&gt;B&lt;/p&gt;\n','&lt;p&gt;C&lt;/p&gt;\n','&lt;p&gt;D&lt;/p&gt;\n','','B',0.25,'',0),(5,'&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;serif&amp;quot;&quot;&gt;According to Amos, God&amp;#39;s judgment is based on: A) Ritual observance B) Social behavior C) Economic status D) Nationality&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\n','&lt;p&gt;A&lt;/p&gt;\n','&lt;p&gt;B&lt;/p&gt;\n','&lt;p&gt;C&lt;/p&gt;\n','&lt;p&gt;D&lt;/p&gt;\n','','B',0.25,'',0),(6,'&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;serif&amp;quot;&quot;&gt;What did Amos say about those who oppress the poor? A) They will be blessed B) They will be punished C) They will be ignored D) They will be rewarded&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\n','&lt;p&gt;A&lt;/p&gt;\n','&lt;p&gt;B&lt;/p&gt;\n','&lt;p&gt;C&lt;/p&gt;\n','&lt;p&gt;D&lt;/p&gt;\n','','B',0.25,'',0),(7,'&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;serif&amp;quot;&quot;&gt;Amos taught that true worship involves: A) Singing hymns B) Offering sacrifices C) Seeking justice D) Building temples&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\n','&lt;p&gt;A&lt;/p&gt;\n','&lt;p&gt;B&lt;/p&gt;\n','&lt;p&gt;C&lt;/p&gt;\n','&lt;p&gt;D&lt;/p&gt;\n','','C',0.25,'',0),(8,'&lt;p style=&quot;margin-left:0cm; margin-right:0cm; text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri,&amp;quot;sans-serif&amp;quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;serif&amp;quot;&quot;&gt;According to Amos, what is God&amp;#39;s expectation from His people? A) External rituals B) Social justice and righteousness C) Economic prosperity D) Military power&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\n','&lt;p&gt;A&lt;/p&gt;\n','&lt;p&gt;B&lt;/p&gt;\n','&lt;p&gt;C&lt;/p&gt;\n','&lt;p&gt;D&lt;/p&gt;\n','','B',0.25,'',0),(9,'&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;serif&amp;quot;&quot;&gt;Amos&amp;#39; prophecies highlighted the need for: A) Religious reform B) Social reform C) Economic reform D) Political reform&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\n','&lt;p&gt;A&lt;/p&gt;\n','&lt;p&gt;B&lt;/p&gt;\n','&lt;p&gt;C&lt;/p&gt;\n','&lt;p&gt;D&lt;/p&gt;\n','','B',0.25,'',0),(10,'&lt;p style=&quot;margin-left:0cm; margin-right:0cm; text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri,&amp;quot;sans-serif&amp;quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;serif&amp;quot;&quot;&gt;What is the core message of Amos&amp;#39; prophecies? A) God&amp;#39;s love for Israel B) God&amp;#39;s judgment on social injustice C) God&amp;#39;s demand for ritual worship D) God&amp;#39;s promise of prosperity.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\n','&lt;p&gt;A&lt;/p&gt;\n','&lt;p&gt;B&lt;/p&gt;\n','&lt;p&gt;C&lt;/p&gt;\n','&lt;p&gt;D&lt;/p&gt;\n','','B',0.25,'',0),(11,'&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;serif&amp;quot;&quot;&gt;What was Hosea&amp;#39;s prophetic message to Israel? A) Judgment and destruction B) Repentance and restoration C) Hope and prosperity D) All of the above&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\n','&lt;p&gt;A&lt;/p&gt;\n','&lt;p&gt;B&lt;/p&gt;\n','&lt;p&gt;C&lt;/p&gt;\n','&lt;p&gt;D&lt;/p&gt;\n','','D',0.25,'',0),(12,'&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;serif&amp;quot;&quot;&gt;What was the significance of Hosea&amp;#39;s marriage to Gomer? A) It symbolized God&amp;#39;s love for Israel B) It represented Israel&amp;#39;s idolatry and unfaithfulness C) It demonstrated the importance of marriage D) It showed the power of love &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\n','&lt;p&gt;A&lt;/p&gt;\n','&lt;p&gt;B&lt;/p&gt;\n','&lt;p&gt;C&lt;/p&gt;\n','&lt;p&gt;D&lt;/p&gt;\n','','B',0.25,'',0),(13,'&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;serif&amp;quot;&quot;&gt;What was Gomer&amp;#39;s behavior like in the story? A) Faithful and obedient B) Unfaithful and promiscuous C) Loving and caring D) Wise and prudent &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\n','&lt;p&gt;A&lt;/p&gt;\n','&lt;p&gt;B&lt;/p&gt;\n','&lt;p&gt;C&lt;/p&gt;\n','&lt;p&gt;D&lt;/p&gt;\n','','B',0.25,'',0),(14,'&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;serif&amp;quot;&quot;&gt;How did Hosea respond to Gomer&amp;#39;s unfaithfulness? A) He divorced her B) He punished her C) He loved her still and sought to redeem her D) He ignored her&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\n','&lt;p&gt;A&lt;/p&gt;\n','&lt;p&gt;B&lt;/p&gt;\n','&lt;p&gt;C&lt;/p&gt;\n','&lt;p&gt;D&lt;/p&gt;\n','','C',0.25,'',0),(15,'&lt;p style=&quot;margin-left:0cm; margin-right:0cm; text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri,&amp;quot;sans-serif&amp;quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;serif&amp;quot;&quot;&gt;What did Hosea&amp;#39;s relationship with Gomer symbolize in relation to God and Israel? A) God&amp;#39;s judgment on Israel B) God&amp;#39;s love and desire for restoration C) Israel&amp;#39;s obedience to God D) God&amp;#39;s abandonment of Israel &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\n','&lt;p&gt;A&lt;/p&gt;\n','&lt;p&gt;B&lt;/p&gt;\n','&lt;p&gt;C&lt;/p&gt;\n','&lt;p&gt;D&lt;/p&gt;\n','','B',0.25,'',0),(16,'&lt;p style=&quot;margin-left:0cm; margin-right:0cm; text-align:justify&quo