INSERT INTO `ss2matthewquest934` VALUES (1,'????? A bag contains 2 red and 3 white balls. If a ball is picked at random from the bag, what is the probability that it is red? (a) 1/6      (b)1/3      ? 2/5      (d) 1/2','A','B','C','D','','C',1,'',1),(2,'? The probability that Ada passess her Mathematics examination is  What is the probability that she fails the examination?  (a) 1/6    (b) 5/6   (c) 1/2   (d) 2/3   ','A','B','C','D','','B',1,'',2),(3,'? A box contains 2 white and 3 blue identical balls. If two balls are picked at random, one after the other, without replacement, what is the probability of picking two balls of different colours? (a)  5/25   (b) 7/20   (c) 3/5    (d) 2/3','A','B','C','D','','C',1,'',3),(4,'The probability of a boy passing English and Mathematics tests are x and y respectively. Find the probability of the boy failing both tests (a) 1-(x-y)+xy       (b) 1-(x+y)-xy          (c) 1-(x+y)+xy            (d) 1+(x-y)+xy  ','A','B','C','D','','C',1,'',4),(6,'&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt=&quot;&quot; src=&quot;../../questUploadImages/questionImages/198523329.png&quot; style=&quot;height:290px; width:949px&quot; /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\n','&lt;p&gt;A&lt;/p&gt;\n','&lt;p&gt;B&lt;/p&gt;\n','&lt;p&gt;C&lt;/p&gt;\n','&lt;p&gt;D&lt;/p&gt;\n','','A',1,'',0),(7,'&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt=&quot;&quot; src=&quot;../../questUploadImages/questionImages/727523068.png&quot; style=&quot;height:239px; width:990px&quot; /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\n','&lt;p&gt;A&lt;/p&gt;\n','&lt;p&gt;B&lt;/p&gt;\n','&lt;p&gt;C&lt;/p&gt;\n','&lt;p&gt;D&lt;/p&gt;\n','','D',1,'',0),(8,'&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt=&quot;&quot; src=&quot;../../questUploadImages/questionImages/2099003109.png&quot; style=&quot;height:67px; width:909px&quot; /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\n','&lt;p&gt;A&lt;/p&gt;\n','&lt;p&gt;B&lt;/p&gt;\n','&lt;p&gt;C&lt;/p&gt;\n','&lt;p&gt;D&lt;/p&gt;\n','','C',1,'',0),(9,'&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt=&quot;&quot; src=&quot;../../questUploadImages/questionImages/1423927249.png&quot; style=&quot;height:78px; width:897px&quot; /&g