INSERT INTO `ss2thirdquest371` VALUES (1,'&lt;p&gt;From the words lettered A to D, choose the word that contains the sound represented by the phonetic symbol&lt;/p&gt;\n\n&lt;p&gt;1./a:/ (a) clap (b) plant (c) bald (d) bake&lt;/p&gt;\n','&lt;p&gt;A&lt;/p&gt;\n','&lt;p&gt;B&lt;/p&gt;\n','&lt;p&gt;C&lt;/p&gt;\n','&lt;p&gt;D&lt;/p&gt;\n','','B',0.5,'',1),(2,'&lt;p&gt;2./i/ (a) might (b) site (c) manage (d) people&lt;/p&gt;\n','&lt;p&gt;A&lt;/p&gt;\n','&lt;p&gt;B&lt;/p&gt;\n','&lt;p&gt;C&lt;/p&gt;\n','&lt;p&gt;D&lt;/p&gt;\n','','C',0.5,'',2),(3,'/e/   (a) delicious      (b) business     (c) butler      (d) jeopardy','A','B','C','D','','C',0.5,'',3),(4,'&lt;p&gt;4./&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;serif&amp;quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;ɒ&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;/ (a) pork (b) court (c) exotic (d) claw&lt;/p&gt;\n','&lt;p&gt;A&lt;/p&gt;\n','&lt;p&gt;B&lt;/p&gt;\n','&lt;p&gt;C&lt;/p&gt;\n','&lt;p&gt;D&lt;/p&gt;\n','','D',0.5,'',4),(5,'&lt;p&gt;5./&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:8.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;serif&amp;quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;ƏƱ&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;/ (a) book (b) month (c) hole (d) hostel&lt;/p&gt;\n','&lt;p&gt;A&lt;/p&gt;\n','&lt;p&gt;B&lt;/p&gt;\n','&lt;p&gt;C&lt;/p&gt;\n','&lt;p&gt;D&lt;/p&gt;\n','','C',0.5,'',5),(6,'In each of the questions, choose the option that is nearest in meaning to the word or phrase underlined. 1.?????  Chinua Achebe is a renowned novelist (A) wonderful (B) famous (C) witty (D) fascinating','A','B','C','D','','C',0.5,'',6),(7,'1.????? He was kept in a solitary confinement. (A) quiet (B) inimical (C) idle    (D) lonely','A','B','C','D','','B',0.5,'',7),(8,'8.????? Nelson Mandela surmounted all the oppressive measures to break his will. (A) overcame  (B) fought','(C) renounced   ','(D)accepted','C','D','','D',0.5,'',8),(9,'9.????? The guest was described as a man of very alluring personality. (A) tempestuous (B) mercurial   (C)  intricate  (D) charming','A','B','C','D','','A',0.5,'',9),(10,'10.????? The comments of the host further incensed the angry man. (A) calmed (B) infuriated (C) incised  (D) pacified','A','B','C','D','','D',0.5,'',10),(11,'Choose from the options lettered A-D the option that most appropriately completes each sentence. 1.????? Margaret forgot to buy _______. (A) a trousers  (B) one trousers  (C) a pair of trousers  (D) plenty trousers.','A','B','C','D','','B',0.5,'',11),(12,'','A','B','C','D','','C',0.5,'',0),(13,'1.????? He was charged _______ stealing from the company?s safe. (A) about (B) in (C) of  (D) with','A','B','C','D','','D',0.5,'',12),(14,'13.? The teacher had hardly turned his back ____the class become noisy. (A) than (B) when (C)then (D) hence','A','B','C','D','','B',0.5,'',13),(15,'14.????? The hardened criminal was convicted ___ breaking into Danso?s house.  (A) with (B) in  (C) of  (D)  for','A','B','C','D','','C',0.5,'',14),(16,'15.????? It?s about time your brother _______ some attention to his English. (A) pays (B) is paying (C) paid (D) had paid ','A','B','C','D','','C',0.5,'',15),(17,'16.????? The government which........recruiting........ workers suddenly stopped doing so. (a) are/its (b) was/its (c) is / their (d) were / their','A','B','C','D','','B',0.5,'',16),(18,'17.????? The employer, not the salesman and his representative.......responsible for the loss. (a) are (b) are never (c) are being (d) is','A','B','C','D','','D',0.5,'',17),(19,'18.????? The book is not in this locker and it is not in that cupboard? (a)neither (b) again (c) either (d) even','A','B','C','D','','C',0.5,'',18),(20,'19.????? If Remi performs poorly in her forth coming examination, then either her mother or I........to blame. (a) must (b) has (c) are (d) am','A','B','C','D','','D',0.5,'',19),(21,'20.????? Neither Adamu nor Musa ?? at home when Idris arrived. (a)was (b) were (c) are (d) is','A','B','C','D','','D',0.5,'',20);
